# Phase 2 real-market data: private, never redistributed (phase2-design.md, Section 1, condition 6)
/data/

# Phase 2: files that hold outcomes, prices or raw API data are never committed, wherever
# they are copied (phase2-design.md, Section 1 condition 6, and 10.12). data/ above
# already covers their default location; these rules also cover copies elsewhere.
*.outcomes.json
histories_*.json
histories_*.jsonl
markets_*_cutoff_*.json
metadata_closed_markets_*.json
metadata_progress*.jsonl
trial_metadata_*.json
request_log.jsonl
*.json.gz
# the market-ID lists stay private while the repository is public (condition 6, 2026-10-16);
# their .sha256 files are committed
frozen_market_list.json
fill_plan_*.json
